<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
    <li>📁 Cross-platform path and file utilities — normalize, join, and manipulate file paths with ease.</li>
    <li>🔐 Authenticated file encryption/decryption (AES-256-GCM) powered by OpenSSL.</li>
    <li>🗜️ Create, compress and extract archives (<code>.tar</code>, <code>.tar.gz</code>, <code>.tar.bz2</code>).</li>
    <li>📂 Recursive file discovery with advanced filters and options.</li>
    <li>🧪 100% unit-test line coverage, ensuring reliability and maintainability.</li>
</ul>

<h3>📦 Installation</h3>
<p>This library requires <a href="https://php.net/releases/" target="_blank">PHP 8.4+</a> and is installed via <a href="https://getcomposer.org/" target="_blank">Composer</a>:</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">composer require oihana/php-files</pre>

<h3>✅ Tests &amp; coverage</h3>
<p>Run the unit-test suite (PHPUnit, strict mode):</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">composer test</pre>

<p>Run a single test case:</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">./vendor/bin/phpunit --filter OpenSSLFileEncryptionTest</pre>

<p>Measure coverage (requires Xdebug or PCOV):</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">composer coverage
composer coverage:md</pre>

<p>The suite covers <strong>100% of lines</strong> (1416/1416). See the testing guide:
    <a href="https://github.com/BcommeBois/oihana-php-files/blob/main/wiki/en/testing.md" target="_blank">English</a> ·
    <a href="https://github.com/BcommeBois/oihana-php-files/blob/main/wiki/fr/testing.md" target="_blank">Français</a>.
</p>

